Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790251199999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790207999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The 27 bars from 1787356800000 to 1789603200000 are a genuine trading range (2357.18-2680) with overlapping bars and no net progress, so much of the post-spike period is two-sided rather than a clean channel.", "The final bar 1790121600000 closed 2684.16, near the low of its range (close ~29%), back below the 2680 range top and the 2700 high of bar 1789776000000, so the breakout above the range has no follow-through yet.", "Bar 1787270400000 closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail after reaching 2771, showing sellers active near the highs; price then spent 27 bars below that high before exceeding it.", "The first ~70% of the window is a bear leg to 1368.42 plus a wide 1512.91-1974.46 range; a sustained bull trend is only visible from bar 1787097600000 onward, so the bull regime rests on the newer portion of the window."], "evidence_for": ["Two very large bull trend bars anchor the bull read: bar 1787097600000 (close 2252.16, top ~87% of range) and bar 1789948800000 (close 2775.61, top ~64% of a 208.3 range, new window high 2850).", "Swing sequence since the post-spike low is up: low 2358.62 (bar 1789430400000) held just above 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) and was followed by a higher high at 2850.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 closed on progressively higher levels and closed above the 2680 top of the preceding 27-bar range, i.e. a breakout attempt at the upper boundary rather than at the lower one.", "The current pullback is shallow so far: two bars and 2641.37, roughly a 42% retrace of the 2358.62-2850 leg, and far above the 2357.18 range low, so no higher low has been broken."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars from 1779840000000 to 1790207999999; window low 1368.42 (bar 1780704000000 low), window high 2850 (bar 1789948800000 high).", "Opening bear leg: bars 1779840000000-1780704000000 fell from bar-0 high 2094.02 to bar-10 low 1368.42, with five consecutive lower closes (1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55) and large bear ranges.", "Bars 1780790400000-1787011200000 stayed two-sided inside 1512.91 (bar-30 low) to 1974.46 (bar-61 high), heavy bar overlap, small bodies, no sustained trend.", "Bar 1787097600000 was the window's largest bull bar: open 1916.51, high 2293.8, low 1905.63, close 2252.16 (range 388.17, close in top ~87% of the bar).", "Bars 1787184000000-1787270400000 extended to highs 2348.02 and 2771, but the second closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail (close near 43% of its 445.69 range).", "Bars 1787356800000-1789603200000 traded sideways between 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000 low) and 2680 (bar 1789084800000 high) with overlapping bars and repeated two-sided closes.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 advanced from open 2446.22 to high 2850, closing above the 2680 top of that 27-bar range; the last bar of the leg, 1789948800000, closed 2775.61 in the top ~64% of its 208.3 range.", "Final two bars pulled back: 1789948800000 close 2752.43 and bar 1790121600000 open 2752.43, high 2786.81, low 2641.37, close 2684.16 (close near 29% of its 145.44 range), back below the 2680-2700 area.", "Pullback low 2641.37 retraces about 42% of the 2358.62-2850 advance, and recent swing sequence remains 2358.62 low (bar 1789430400000) vs 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) with a higher high at 2850."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: ten bars of lower closes from bar-0 high 2094.02 down to bar-10 low 1368.42, dominated by five consecutive large bear bars; the low was not revisited for the rest of the window.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779840000000, "upper_boundary": "2094.02"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the bear leg, from bar-30 low 1512.91 to bar-61 high 1974.46; overlapping bars, small bodies, no clean trend bars in either direction.", "end_time_ms": 1787011200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike from bar 1787097600000 (open 1916.51, close 2252.16, low 1905.63) through highs 2348.02 and 2771; the spike closed the range at 1512.91-1974.46 and is the largest single-bar expansion in the window.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range, 27 bars between bar 1788307200000 low 2357.18 and bar 1789084800000 high 2680; repeated overlapping bars and mid-bar closes show two-sided trading below the 2771 spike high.", "end_time_ms": 1789603200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Four-bar bull leg from bar 1789689600000 (open 2446.22, low 2436.87) up to the window high 2850 at bar 1789948800000, closing above the 2357.18-2680 range top; bars 1790035200000 and 1790121600000 then pulled back to 2641.37 and closed back below the 2680-2700 area, so acceptance above the range is not yet shown.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850, or two consecutive closes above 2786.81 (bar 1790121600000 high), would show acceptance above the range and make the current phase spike-like rather than channel-like.", "Range/failed breakout: a close below 2641.37 (bar 1790121600000 low) followed by a close below 2436.87 (bar 1789689600000 low) would return price into the 2357.18-2680 range and shift the read toward trading-range/range.", "Bull-trend invalidation: a close below 2357.18 would break the range low and the higher-low sequence, re-opening a bear leg toward the 1789430400000 low area.", "A sequence of overlapping bars holding between 2680 and 2850 with no new high would confirm the recent advance as a channel segment inside an increasingly range-like structure."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790236799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Since the 2850.00 high 14 bars ago the market has made no new high and printed a lower high 2804.59 (bar 106); the pullback to 2641.37 gives back ~74% of the final 2568.16-2850.00 impulse, a deep retrace that fits an exhausted or climactic leg as well as a flag.", "Bar 116 is a bear trend bar (O2726.71 C2659.00, range 79.28) that broke the nine-bar 2716.01-2786.81 flag floor, and all five closes since (2659.00, 2676.47, 2684.16, 2675.48, 2692.23) remain below 2716.01, so the breakout has not been reclaimed and bears still hold the level.", "Bar 103 (O2658.81 H2850.00 C2723.15) left a ~127-point upper tail and was never exceeded; the following bars 107-115 compressed into a ~2.5%-wide overlapping range, and this 14-bar pullback is roughly three times longer than the 3-5 bar pullbacks of the same leg - momentum has deteriorated even though the higher-low sequence holds.", "The recent bars are not compressed relative to typical bar size in this window (last three ranges 27.78, 24.53, 28.69 vs ~30-40 point ranges in the first half), so the current structure reads as a normal two-sided range rather than a tight one-way continuation pattern."], "evidence_for": ["Higher swing lows across the window's second half: 2358.62 (bar 69) then 2436.87 (bar 83) then 2568.16 (bar 97) then 2641.37 (bar 117), with a higher high 2850.00 (bar 103) above the earlier window highs 2680.00 (bar 44) and 2700.00 (bars 91 and 101).", "The 2641.37 pullback low held above the prior swing low 2568.16, and the final four bars made rising lows (2641.37, 2668.06, 2666.20, 2669.37) with closes climbing to 2692.23 - buyers responded at the range low instead of accelerating the breakdown.", "The bull leg is carried by wide trend bars closing near their highs (bar 86 close 2578.60 off a 89.68 range; bar 87 close 2636.28; bar 104 close 2754.31), and the earlier break to the window low 2358.62 below the ~2411.04 range floor was a failed bear breakout followed by a ~21% rally, showing downside breaks in this window have not held.", "The current consolidation is only ~14 bars and retraces ~44% of the 2436.87-2804.59 leg, a depth common for bull-flag pullbacks inside a channel; the last three bars are small and overlapping, consistent with a pause rather than a decisive reversal.", "Candle reads add no opposing evidence: all 120 bars have complete OHLC, and the leg structure and boundaries are fully locatable from the supplied closes and extremes."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars (1788508800000-1790236799999); window opens 2503.47 and closes 2692.23 (+6.7%). Window high 2850.00 at 1789977600000, window low 2358.62 at 1789488000000.", "Bars 1-43 form a two-sided range about 2411.04-2537.57 with many small overlapping bars (e.g. bars 3-8 all inside 2442.47-2461.36). Bar 44 (1789128000000) is a spike bar, O2457.12 H2680.00 L2444.19 C2555.52, leaving a ~124-point upper tail; bars 45-68 give the spike back and top at 2609.02 (bar 64).", "Bars 68-69 break to the window low 2358.62 (bar 69: O2423.22 H2442.15 L2358.62 C2412.95, range 83.53); that break gets no follow-through, and bars 70-83 build a higher low 2436.87.", "Bars 83-106 rally from 2436.87 to 2804.59 (~15%) with trend bars closing near highs: bar 86 range 89.68 (C2578.60), bar 87 range 65.08 (C2636.28), bar 103 O2658.81 H2850.00 C2723.15 (range 191.94), bar 104 H2795.00 C2754.31; one intermediate pullback to 2568.16 (bar 97).", "Recent 14 bars: 2850.00 high (bar 103) then lower high 2804.59 (bar 106, 1790020800000); nine-bar contraction 2716.01-2786.81 (bars 107-115); bar 116 (1790164800000) is a bear trend bar O2726.71 C2659.00 (range 79.28) breaking the contraction low 2716.01; bar 117 (1790179200000) makes a lower low 2641.37 and closes 2676.47 (bull reversal body).", "Last three bars are small and overlapping (ranges 27.78, 24.53, 28.69; closes 2684.16, 2675.48, 2692.23) with rising lows 2668.06, 2666.20, 2669.37, but all closes remain below the broken floor 2716.01 and far below 2804.59.", "Pullback math: 2641.37 retraces 163.22 points (~44%) of the 2436.87-2804.59 leg and 208.63 points (~74%) of the final 2568.16-2850.00 impulse; earlier pullbacks in the leg were 3-5 bars, this one is 14 bars."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bull leg/channel from the 2358.62 low (bar at 1789488000000) to the 2850.00 high (bar at 1789977600000): two rising pullbacks (2568.16 at bar 97, 2641.37 at bar 117) and repeated wide bull trend bars alternating with overlapping pullback bars, so the leg reads as a channel with a spike segment (bars 103-104) rather than a clean one-direction spike.", "end_time_ms": 1789977600000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Fourteen-bar two-sided range after the 2804.59 high (bar at 1790020800000): high 2804.59, low 2641.37. Contains a failed push above the prior 2850.00 high, a nine-bar tight sub-range 2716.01-2786.81, a bear breakout at bar 116 that was not reclaimed (all closes since remain under 2716.01), and a two-legged pullback that keeps the 2641.37 low above the prior swing low 2568.16.", "end_time_ms": 1790222400000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2641.37", "start_time_ms": 1790020800000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Bear breakout attempt of the nine-bar bull-flag range 2716.01-2786.81: bar 116 (1790164800000) closes 2659.00 below the flag floor and bar 117 prints a lower low 2641.37, but follow-through is weak - the break only extended ~75 points below 2716.01 and the next three bars closed higher inside a small overlapping range, so acceptance is unproven.", "end_time_ms": 1790222400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2641.37", "start_time_ms": 1790164800000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}, {"description": "Possible reversal structure, not established: wide high 2850.00 with a ~127-point upper tail (bar 103) followed by a lower high 2804.59 (bar 106), a break of the trend line via the drop to 2641.37, but no lower-high-with-follow-through or sustained closes under the pullback low yet.", "end_time_ms": 1790179200000, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2641.37", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull resolution: acceptance back above 2716.01 followed by a break of 2804.59 would show the bar-116 bear breakout failed and the bull trend is resuming toward 2850.00.", "Bear resolution: consecutive closes below 2641.37 with a subsequent rally failing under 2698.06 would confirm the 2804.59 lower high and shift the read from bull-trend/pullback toward trading-range or bear-leg, with 2568.16 as the next structural reference.", "A single large trend bar closing outside 2641.37-2804.59 with follow-through in the next one to three bars would end the two-sided phase; a break without follow-through should be treated as another failed breakout inside the range.", "Continued small overlapping bars between roughly 2666 and 2716 would keep the structure a range and keep Always-In relevance low."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2640.34", "close_time_ms": 1789822799999, "high": "2641.79"